; Literature-aligned ferrocyanide topology for benchmark input
; Primary source: Prampolini et al., J. Phys. Chem. B 2014, 118, 14899-14912.
; DOI: 10.1021/jp511391b
; Bonded values cross-checked against the supplied literature extract, Table 4.2.
; Fe-C and C-N use harmonic bonds (GROMACS funct=1), matching E=1/2 K(x-x0)^2.
; CCCC/NNNN coplanarity uses harmonic improper dihedrals (GROMACS funct=2).

